%% 客户端合同真源: /System/Volumes/Data/workspace/worktrees/sync-event-alignment/cses-client/specs/003-messagev3-gate-inventory/gates/channel/mv3-g10e/contract.json
%% UI owners: src/pages/message-v3/service/channelConfigBase.service.ts::setNotify；src/pages/message-v3/service/message.service.ts::changeChannelState
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant UI as Angular UI
  participant Gate as MessageV3 Gate Port
  participant Native as Tauri Native
  participant FFI as Flutter FFI
  participant Web as Browser Web
  participant E as ExecutionShell Tick
  participant IM as helix-im
  participant Host as driver-host
  participant DB as tenant SQLite
  participant Go as Go IM Server
  participant WS as WS inbound
  participant Sink as EventSink raw bytes
  Note over UI,Gate: 用户目标：成员对某个会话开启免打扰后，这个会话来新消息不再弹提醒，列表上出现静音标记，但未读数照常累计。
  Note over UI,Web: 当前覆盖状态：mock=implemented；helix=focused-unit；native-real=BLOCKED_PRECONDITION（运行中 Go notify route 返回 not found）；该图是交互合同，不把 Mock、HTTP 2xx 或静态注册写成真实 Green
  alt PC Tauri 入口
    UI->>Gate: changeChannelState(payload)
    Gate->>Native: invokeAccepted("im_channel_member_notify", payload)
    Native->>E: Tick::Command(AppCommand)
  else Flutter FFI 入口
    FFI->>E: helix_command("im_channel_member_notify", payload)
  else Browser Web 入口
    Web->>E: invoke("im_channel_member_notify", payload)
  end
  E->>IM: ExecutionShell::step(Tick::Command)
  IM->>IM: 校验 会话消息免打扰 的入参，生成 corr_key/req_id
  IM->>Host: Effect::Http POST /channel/member/change/notify
  Host->>Go: HTTP request with tenant/auth/corr headers
  Go-->>Host: HTTP response（2xx 只代表 admission/query response）
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(http)
  E->>IM: correlate req_id/corr_key
  Go-->>WS: WS authority event or canonical result
  WS->>E: Tick::Inbound(authority bytes)
  E->>IM: apply authoritative event before settlement
  IM->>Host: Effect::Persist{BatchUpdate channel.notify_props + BatchUpsert channel_member.notify + Get(channel)}
  Host->>DB: ordered viewer-local writes then durable channel readback
  DB-->>Host: PortReply(PersistOk)
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(PersistOk)
  E->>IM: release only matching PersistOk corr
  E->>IM: channel row readback is the projection source
  IM->>Sink: Effect::Emit {event,data}（readback channelUpdate，im:channel:update）
  Sink-->>UI: Native im:__bus__ raw event → Angular projection
  Sink-->>FFI: FFI batch raw {event,data}
  Sink-->>Web: Web EventBatch raw {event,data}
  alt HTTP / PortReply / Persist error
    IM->>IM: keep prior durable state；attach structured error to corr_key
    IM-->>E: Err or correlated error result
    E-->>Gate: controlled failure
    Gate-->>UI: error / empty state；不得伪造成功事件
  end
  Note over IM,DB: 正式 MessageV3 输出：data.notifyProps === 入参 NORMAL／STRONG／IGNORE（scalar）；Go increment、SQLite render-ready 与当前 PC UI 均消费此形状。notify-only 另镜像 channel_member.notify，但不写 unreadCount / channelIsTop / 其他缺省字段
  Note over UI,Web: 关键负向：免打扰不得清零 unreadCount：开启前后 unreadCount 必须逐值相等，后续新消息仍累计（只抑制提醒）；notify 缺失、非法或混入共享字段时 fail-closed，不发布 im:channel:update
  Note over E,Sink: 出站事件集合：channelUpdate，UPDATE_CHANNEL，im:channel:update；跨端只搬运 {event,data} 原始字节，不在 shell 复制 reducer
